{"title": "Dearest Fireliia", "pageid": 35700, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dearest_Fireliia", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_O_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Book_Note_O_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_O_Image.png.webp, /w/images/4/4c/Book_Note_O_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dearest Fireliia image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Book_Note_O_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_O_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Book_Note_O_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A letter directed to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath\" title=\"Lady Jannath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/25px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/38px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/50px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Jannath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/25px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lady Jannath\">Lady Jannath</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-fam